# Vercel serves this repository as plain static files. Deploy only what the
# site uses; build sources, tests and the full-size originals stay in git only.
/*
!index.html
!404.html
!it
!de
!fr
!es
!assets
!robots.txt
!sitemap.xml
!vercel.json

# Originals (tens of MB, may carry camera metadata): the site uses assets/img
# and assets/video, generated by `python -m sitebuild.media`.
assets/images
assets/videos
